<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Hume year net up 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Hume year net up 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 52.3    vs	  35.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		 3,715.68   vs     3,190.30</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   242.51   vs	 182.45</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 59.34   vs  less  58.21</p>
<p>    Net profit		 129.53   vs	  86.93</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    12.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Hume Industries (Malaysia) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
